Files: crates/ferrofin-model/src/net/mime_types/base_type_map.rs
Copyright: 2024 Kristian Hellang
           2014 Jonathan Ong
           2015-2022 Douglas Christopher Wilson
License: Apache-2.0 and Expat
Comment: The extension to MIME type table of the MimeTypes NuGet package,
 version 2.5.2 (https://github.com/khellang/MimeTypes, Apache-2.0), which
 Jellyfin uses; that package generates it from mime-db
 (https://github.com/jshttp/mime-db, Expat). Both notices are kept beside
 the file.

